TYPES.md §3.3 (E2102), §1, DECISIONS 209: a record check with a static error of its own is broken,
so its record is too, and the let typed by it: none of them is evaluated (EVALUATION.md §1).
-- features/mail/mail.canon --
/// Mails.
package features.mail

/// A mail.
record Mail {
  /// Its subject.
  subject: String
  warn attachment == "gold" else "a holiday mail usually carries penya"
}

/// The mails.
let mails: [Mail] = [{ subject: "Spring cleaning" }]
-- findings.txt --
warning[W4001]  features/mail/mail.canon:5:8
  1 value was not evaluated or checked because features.mail.Mail is broken: fix the errors in it or in the types it names

error[E2102]  features/mail/mail.canon:8:8
  unknown name attachment

1 error, 1 warning in 1 package (…)
